<title>USA: Hewlett-Packard completes acquisition.</title>
<headline>Hewlett-Packard completes acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>PALO ALTO, Calif. 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hewlett-Packard Co said Friday it has completed its acquisition of Prolin, a software company based in Amsterdam.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Prolin will retain its name and operate as a business unit within Hewlett-Packard's OpenView program at Prolin's current location. Prolin also will continue under the direction of Jerome Mol, Hewlett-Packard said.</p>
<p>(-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610)</p>
</text>
